/target
# standalone example crates (their own [workspace], e.g. wasm-hello) build here too
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock
.DS_Store
.tokensave/
.claude/
.agents/
.commandcode/

# local harness artifact
.pi/

# Stray 0-byte files a subagent's shell redirect has left in the repo root
# during past sessions (e.g. a misparsed `> i32` from a Rust type name
# appearing where a real path was expected). Root-only (no leading `**/`),
# named narrowly rather than broadly, so this never hides a real source file
# anywhere in the tree — extend this list if the same failure mode recurs
# under a different name (P7, `docs/tui-pending-action-plan.md`).
/i32
/bool
/SessionStateView
